   "cooked": "<p><strong>Seeking token design help on a new NFT project.</strong></p>\n<p>Our project is founded by 5 high profile social media influencer with a combined audience of over 5m followers.  This will be an utility token to gain access/membership to exclusive entertainment and saving on community branded products and services such as mobile services, insurance, events, and travel. 90% of all the proceeds from the NFT sales will go directly into buying the products and services.</p>\n<p>I need someone to join the team that has experience designing generative tokens tied to a bonding curve. Feel free to reach out directly at <a href=\"mailto:ruvested@gmail.com\">ruvested@gmail.com</a></p>",
